## How to use this

- **One topic per file** in `memory/`. Topic files rarely collide because different sessions touch different topics — a single monolithic memory file is a guaranteed collision point.
- Add a row here when you create a topic file. Never put the content itself in this index.
- Convert relative dates to absolute (`2026-09-02`, not "last week").
- When something is **adjudicated**, it belongs in [[01 Master/Settled — do not re-open|Settled — do not re-open]], not here.
